Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,[
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.88,0:01:41.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,Hello, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.20,0:02:42.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,Leo/need...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.40,0:04:20.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,Welcome to ProSeka AfterTalk: "The Stars Are Hidden in the Blue of the Night Sky" edition!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.40,0:04:28.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm Karin Isobe, the voice of Saki Tenma.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.08,0:04:37.36,Default,host,0,0,0,,Tonight's program is where we look back on the event while reading the messages you've sent in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.36,0:04:42.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,This time, we're looking at "The Stars Are Hidden in the Blue of the Night Sky."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.28,0:04:50.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,The script asks, "Did everyone enjoy the story?" but I'm not sure if "enjoy" is the right word...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.28,0:05:00.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,As I mentioned on X, this story was quite heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.00,0:05:11.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,I could really feel how important this story will be for Saki-chan going forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.48,0:05:15.10,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm sure it really hit home for all of you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.10,0:05:21.58,Default,host,0,0,0,,I have so many thoughts and feelings about it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.58,0:05:26.52,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'll look back on everything together with the messages you've sent in.
Comment: 0,0:10:54.64,0:11:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Fan Letter Corner ===
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.64,0:11:03.28,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,AfterTalk has had a bit of a renewal, and we've already received messages for the show on the official ProSeka Discord.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.28,0:11:06.08,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,Thank you all so much for sending in so many messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.68,0:11:11.50,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,I'll be introducing some of the messages we received during the program,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.50,0:11:12.48,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,so please look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.28,0:11:21.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,Also, please post your thoughts on the event or this broadcast using the hashtag #ProSekaAfterTalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:23.70,Default,host,0,0,0,,The staff have set up the YouTube chat so I can see it right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.70,0:11:26.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,Everyone's saying "kon-needo"!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.64,0:11:27.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,Kon-needo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.65,0:11:30.15,Default,host,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:32.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.32,0:11:36.04,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Someone said they got anxious and cried during the last scene."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.48,0:11:38.95,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"And someone else said they should have sent a message."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.95,0:11:39.57,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"You should have!"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.80,0:11:41.52,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Please do send them in."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.20,0:11:47.08,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Oh, someone wrote that this was a turning point for Saki-chan."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.76,0:11:49.66,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thanks for all the "kon-needo" greetings!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.66,0:11:50.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.80,0:11:59.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,I have the YouTube chat right here in front of me, so I can see everyone's thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.40,0:12:03.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,Hearing from you all is the best part of AfterTalk, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.16,0:12:08.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,I want to share all these feelings and things we're curious about
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.68,0:12:12.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,with everyone as we go through the program.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.84,0:12:15.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,I hope you'll join me for the rest of the show!
Comment: 0,0:12:16.28,0:12:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Story Watchalong ===
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.28,0:12:17.24,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,All right then,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.16,0:12:26.52,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,I'd like to start talking about the story for this event, "Stars Hidden in the Night Sky."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.52,0:12:33.36,Default,host,0,0,0,,I saw some people mentioning Saki in the comments earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.36,0:12:35.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,but how did you all find the story this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.48,0:12:39.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,It really tugged at my heartstrings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.47,0:12:40.97,Default,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.68,0:12:45.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,For Leoni... and for Leoni as a whole,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.72,0:12:53.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,the ending really made me wonder what's going to happen to Saki-chan next.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.12,0:13:00.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,First, I'll read some of the messages we received about the story and look back on it one step at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.17,0:13:01.67,Default,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.32,0:13:04.60,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"This message is from Mirin-san."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.60,0:13:06.32,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Thank you so much."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.32,0:13:07.88,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Are you watching right now?"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.60,0:13:10.84,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"It was pretty heavy."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.44,0:13:12.96,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"The atmosphere was a bit unsettling."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.93,0:13:15.43,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Yeah."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.35,0:13:16.85,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I see."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.68,0:13:22.12,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Some people are saying it was an amazing story too."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.16,0:13:25.72,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Yeah, that ending though..."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.48,0:13:27.08,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I know, right?"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.08,0:13:30.88,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,Let me read the message from Mirin-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.04,0:13:33.48,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Isobe-san, kon-needo!"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.48,0:13:34.44,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Kon-needo!"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.44,0:13:41.20,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I have so much to say about this event, but first, let me just scream..."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.92,0:13:42.52,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Saki!"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.96,0:13:45.04,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I feel you."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.04,0:13:48.20,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Isn't this just way too sad?"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.20,0:13:48.79,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Yeah."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.79,0:13:52.72,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"She usually says what's on her mind or what she wants to do right away,"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.72,0:13:56.71,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"but when it's the most important thing, she can't say it. It's not good."
Comment: 0,0:13:56.71,0:13:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.71,0:13:57.25,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.88,0:14:02.84,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Between the last Leoni event and how quiet things have been lately, I'm really worried."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.52,0:14:09.34,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I'll wish on a shooting star that the Leoni girls' hearts will clear up as soon as possible!"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.34,0:14:11.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.40,0:14:14.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.16,0:14:21.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,When a normally energetic person starts to feel... how should I put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.12,0:14:25.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,When they're feeling down, it's that contrast...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.80,0:14:30.30,Default,host,0,0,0,,Even in everyday life, when you see someone acting differently than usual,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.30,0:14:37.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,that gap in their personality makes you extra worried about them, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.16,0:14:43.78,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's just like you wrote. Saki-chan is usually the type to...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.78,0:14:49.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,She's very headstrong. When she wants to do something, she just goes for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.56,0:14:53.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,The rest of Leoni usually gives her a bit of a hard time about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.60,0:14:58.36,Default,host,0,0,0,,especially Shiho-chan, who sighs and says "Good grief," but they all...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.36,0:15:03.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,They all go along with her, and she really brightens up the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.48,0:15:10.38,Default,host,0,0,0,,I feel like that's Saki-chan's role, but this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.38,0:15:16.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,at the end of the story... those feelings that started to bud...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.76,0:15:21.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,I don't know what happens after this myself, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.12,0:15:29.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,In this story, she makes the choice not to say anything for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.96,0:15:31.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.84,0:15:34.92,Default,host,0,0,0,,I don't know if I should just call it a "gap" in her personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.56,0:15:40.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,The fact that Saki-chan... that Saki-chan would make this choice...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.07,0:15:41.57,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.35,0:15:42.85,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.84,0:15:47.52,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's quite surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.20,0:15:53.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,But it shows just how much she cares about everyone in Leoni.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.68,0:15:59.74,Default,host,0,0,0,,Of course, it's been shown in the stories leading up to this, like Shiho-chan's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.74,0:16:04.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,Everyone's resolve toward their dream of turning professional and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.72,0:16:14.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,Because she treasures those feelings, she arrived at this choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.32,0:16:16.52,Default,host,0,0,0,,I really feel the same way...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.40,0:16:23.03,Default,host,0,0,0,,I just want to watch over Saki-chan as a fan myself.
Comment: 0,0:16:23.03,0:16:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.03,0:16:23.73,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.32,0:16:28.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,When it comes to the lines I deliver as Saki,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.80,0:16:35.18,Default,host,0,0,0,,this time, since I'm also someone who works in this industry,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.18,0:16:40.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,there were so many parts where I could really understand Saki-chan's feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.88,0:16:49.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,As a performer, my perspective on Saki-chan ended up linking with her in so many different ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.20,0:16:55.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,I've been with Saki-chan for a long time now, and because I understand her various emotions,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.08,0:17:00.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,it was actually quite painful for me as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.44,0:17:04.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'd like to introduce another message.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.28,0:17:07.70,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,This one is from Sakaguchi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.70,0:17:09.22,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.22,0:17:10.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,Right, these three members.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.47,0:17:11.97,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.72,0:17:15.28,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"They said, "Ending the year like this is just too painful!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.36,0:17:18.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thanks for all the comments, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.11,0:17:20.61,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.92,0:17:28.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,And having finished their solo live, their professionalism and the fact they've grown up really shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.64,0:17:35.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's true, everyone has shown such incredible growth
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.12,0:17:36.52,Default,host,0,0,0,,along this journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.52,0:17:44.82,Default,host,0,0,0,,Their ways of thinking change, and their emotions move in different ways than before,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.82,0:17:45.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,which is only natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.52,0:17:49.36,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,Now, let me read the message from Sakaguchi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.36,0:17:50.64,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Isobe-san, kon-needo!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.64,0:17:51.92,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Kon-needo!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.76,0:17:59.70,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"This event story had many scenes of Saki-chan's time in the hospital and her inner conflicts,"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.70,0:18:02.96,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"making it a very heart-wrenching story to watch."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.92,0:18:15.28,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Especially at the end of Episode 8, when Saki-chan resolved never to reveal her feelings just so she could stay with everyone, I couldn't help but cry."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.44,0:18:17.64,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Thank you for that."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.32,0:18:26.16,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"So my question is, what were you conscious of when performing those painful scenes in Episodes 4 and 8?"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.16,0:18:29.72,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I'd also like to know what kind of mindset you had during the recording session."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.44,0:18:34.50,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Isobe-san, you mentioned a little bit about the recording on X..."
Comment: 0,0:18:34.50,0:18:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.50,0:18:36.36,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"It made me want to get to know her even more deeply."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.00,0:18:42.06,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"At the same time, it reminded me how glad I am that Isobe-san is the one playing Saki-chan."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.06,0:18:42.68,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Thank you so much."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.79,0:18:44.29,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"That's so kind."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.88,0:18:47.16,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I love the Saki-chan that Isobe-san portrays."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.16,0:18:50.86,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"The cold days are continuing, so please take care of yourself."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.86,0:18:53.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thank you for such a thoughtful message.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.44,0:18:58.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,First of all, hearing you say that makes me so incredibly happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.88,0:19:00.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,It really does.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.79,0:19:01.29,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.60,0:19:03.57,Default,host,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.57,0:19:04.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,I feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.44,0:19:13.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,Like I mentioned a bit earlier, this time I really tried to empathize with Saki-chan's feelings from many angles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.68,0:19:18.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,There was Saki's perspective, and then there was my own perspective
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.72,0:19:23.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,when I first read the script as a reader.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.96,0:19:30.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,And then there's my professional perspective as a voice actress.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.88,0:19:38.86,Default,host,0,0,0,,All those things overlapped, and as you wrote, episodes 4 and 8 were truly painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.86,0:19:43.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,During the recording session, how should I put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.16,0:19:46.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,It was like...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.95,0:19:48.45,Default,host,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.00,0:19:55.92,Default,host,0,0,0,,I had to try my best to stay calm, if that's the right way to say it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.92,0:20:02.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,Because it felt like my emotions were just going to overflow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.28,0:20:10.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,Even with all these different feelings, I had to keep Saki-chan's core in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.11,0:20:11.61,Default,host,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.24,0:20:17.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,You mentioned asking about what I was conscious of or what I prioritized.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.56,0:20:24.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,If I look at it from all those different angles including my own feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.20,0:20:24.97,Default,host,0,0,0,,then...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.97,0:20:32.52,Default,host,0,0,0,,It becomes too painful, and my emotions really do just spill over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.52,0:20:38.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,But speaking strictly about the recording session, what's most important
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.56,0:20:47.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,is how Saki-chan sees this story, and that's what I focus on as an actress.
Comment: 0,0:20:47.64,0:20:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.64,0:20:52.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,So, I had to keep a core focus on how Saki-chan would feel,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.32,0:20:56.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,and maintain a calm perspective. It's really part of the job,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.96,0:21:02.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,but right now, I'm trying my absolute best to face Saki-chan's expressions
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.20,0:21:06.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,and her feelings head-on during the performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.56,0:21:12.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,Still, I felt during the recording that I shouldn't forget that sense of composure,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.24,0:21:15.46,Default,host,0,0,0,,and that I needed to keep a firm hold on that core.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.46,0:21:17.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,That's just how much it affected me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.52,0:21:23.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,Because of the time I've spent walking alongside Saki-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:29.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,and everything we've been through with Leo/need to get to where we are now,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.88,0:21:37.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,it's like... when you've known someone this long, even if you don't try,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.60,0:21:40.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,those emotions just start overflowing, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.32,0:21:48.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,I think it's the same for all of you. You've told me how painful it was to watch,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.00,0:21:55.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,and I feel like you're all facing those feelings and supporting Leo/need so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.44,0:22:02.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,I think that's why you're able to empathize with their individual emotions like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.20,0:22:07.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,For me personally, the recording was truly, truly painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.84,0:22:14.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,I wanted to talk more about that later, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.24,0:22:16.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,Actually, let's talk about it later as an extra bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.44,0:22:28.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,Moving on, I'd like to introduce a scene that I personally want to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.04,0:22:34.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,I've chosen a scene from Episode 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.56,0:22:41.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,The reason is, I end up watching Episode 4 very intently.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.08,0:22:49.22,Default,host,0,0,0,,There are many painful scenes to look back on, and usually I'm chatting away during the footage,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.22,0:22:59.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,but I think it might be hard to talk then, so I'll explain why I chose this scene first. How's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.68,0:23:00.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,Are you all keeping up?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.64,0:23:01.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,It feels like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.36,0:23:04.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,I've just been talking non-stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.28,0:23:05.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,Are we doing okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.19,0:23:07.69,Default,host,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.71,0:23:11.21,Default,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.32,0:23:16.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's because of Saki's usual energy that the negative emotions are written so effectively.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.80,0:23:21.46,Default,host,0,0,0,,So I tried to weave my words together without getting too emotional.
Comment: 0,0:23:21.46,0:23:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.46,0:23:23.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,Let's talk about Saki's voice recording session.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.65,0:23:25.15,Default,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.84,0:23:32.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,The other three were so emotional about the solo show, but she felt like she was the only one who couldn't keep up. It was so painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.44,0:23:33.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.12,0:23:35.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.16,0:23:38.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,How should I put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.76,0:23:46.26,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's supposed to be a happy thing, but as we watch them...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.26,0:23:53.86,Default,host,0,0,0,,As someone watching over them, it's painful that it feels painful to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.86,0:24:00.26,Default,host,0,0,0,,But I guess it's unavoidable, given everyone's different feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.26,0:24:06.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,Saki-chan is Saki-chan, and her stance as a bassist...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.16,0:24:09.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,Maybe those feelings emerged because she's becoming a professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.72,0:24:11.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.71,0:24:13.21,Default,host,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.88,0:24:14.78,Default,host,0,0,0,,How do I say this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.78,0:24:20.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,She's not doing this half-heartedly. She's facing it head-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.84,0:24:26.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,She's facing the music she wants to make with that kind of sincerity.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.28,0:24:29.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.40,0:24:34.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,I totally get not wanting to be separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.55,0:24:36.05,Default,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.44,0:24:42.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,I wonder if everyone watched this while thinking of their own friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.23,0:24:44.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.88,0:24:50.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,That's how it felt, but for me, Episode 4 was certainly something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.24,0:24:55.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,But Episode 8 in particular really got my emotions going.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.84,0:25:01.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,Whenever I talk about Saki-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.48,0:25:07.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,The reason she can enjoy the present so much is because of her past.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.88,0:25:13.26,Default,host,0,0,0,,She's able to enjoy the now so much. This is just my personal interpretation,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.26,0:25:22.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,not necessarily the official Saki, but how I feel about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.60,0:25:30.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,I feel like her past is something you can't separate from her when talking about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.20,0:25:35.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,Until now, I've always taken that past very positively.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.72,0:25:44.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,Because of that past, Saki-chan can truly enjoy the present. That's what it meant to have fun, but...
Comment: 0,0:25:44.20,0:25:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.20,0:25:46.92,Default,host,0,0,0,,I was thinking about how that's such a wonderful, happy thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.48,0:25:53.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,And this time, because of that past...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.64,0:25:56.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,Saki-chan's current feelings were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.28,0:26:06.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,She went through so much conflict and chose not to say anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.60,0:26:08.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,and...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.32,0:26:09.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,well,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.92,0:26:19.66,Default,host,0,0,0,,it felt like she decided in a completely positive way that "now isn't the time."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.66,0:26:22.92,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's hard to put into words, but do you get what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.56,0:26:27.86,Default,host,0,0,0,,That's how I was looking at Saki-chan this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.86,0:26:29.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,this time around.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.04,0:26:31.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,That's what I thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.04,0:26:33.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,from a viewer's perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.84,0:26:37.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,And when that happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.72,0:26:46.98,Default,host,0,0,0,,the words Tsukasa-san said to her...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.98,0:26:58.52,Default,host,0,0,0,,He says these really affirming things, like how there must have been times in the past when her feelings were realized.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.52,0:27:05.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,I felt like she was saved a little by that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.40,0:27:11.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,There are so many emotions involved, but for Saki-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.64,0:27:20.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,looking back at the past, Episode 4 really made me feel like that's where her starting point is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.28,0:27:25.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,I thought Episode 4 might be a painful scene to look back on with everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.56,0:27:31.30,Default,host,0,0,0,,and I was almost in tears myself during the recording session,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.30,0:27:35.36,Default,host,0,0,0,,but I'd like to look back on it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.12,0:27:38.54,Default,host,0,0,0,,Let's watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.54,0:27:39.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.59,0:27:41.09,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.96,0:27:42.80,Default,host,0,0,0,,?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.28,0:27:50.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,I think hearing that it's "far away" makes her remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.28,0:27:56.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,The loneliness of when she was hospitalized.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.72,0:28:04.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,What she was feeling all that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.65,0:28:17.15,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.16,0:28:21.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,Tsukasa-san really does feel like he's on his second or third life.
Comment: 0,0:28:25.52,0:28:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.52,0:28:29.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,Fumi-chan, who was in the same room, is being discharged.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.80,0:28:31.52,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.48,0:28:33.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,Will I make it in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.76,0:28:37.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,Mom is going to go handle the discharge paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.40,0:28:39.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting for you on the first floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.52,0:28:41.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.72,0:28:43.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm glad I could be a little honest with Tsukasa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.21,0:28:45.71,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.57,0:28:49.07,Default,host,0,0,0,,Fumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.72,0:28:53.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,Now we can go to school together starting tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.96,0:28:57.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm so glad we'll be able to do the haunted house at the school festival together.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.99,0:29:01.49,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.24,0:29:04.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,Doing a haunted house with everyone... I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.24,0:29:07.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm going to see her off and say goodbye to the doctors.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.20,0:29:10.80,Default,host,0,0,0,,Let's play together a lot from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.31,0:29:14.81,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.49,0:29:15.99,Default,host,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.00,0:29:17.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,Saki.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.44,0:29:19.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,The tests are finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.47,0:29:20.97,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.08,0:29:25.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,It took a little longer than expected, but I'm glad I made it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.12,0:29:28.52,Default,host,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.70,0:29:30.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.20,0:29:30.70,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.20,0:29:32.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,Just this part...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.12,0:29:35.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,Seriously, please write down that this line is so painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.13,0:29:39.63,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.36,0:29:49.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,Saki-chan talked to me so much that being in the hospital...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.92,0:29:51.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,It didn't feel lonely at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.44,0:29:56.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,So, really, really...
Comment: 0,0:29:57.09,0:29:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.09,0:29:57.59,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.16,0:30:00.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.52,0:30:02.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.56,0:30:06.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,Here, enjoy your school life.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.16,0:30:08.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.60,0:30:11.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.92,0:30:17.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,Being able to say congratulations here is part of Saki-chan's strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.44,0:30:19.92,Default,host,0,0,0,,School starts tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.24,0:30:22.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.52,0:30:27.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,I don't know what the school festival will be like,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.52,0:30:35.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,but I'm sure it'll be a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.16,0:30:39.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,Don't make a face like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.97,0:30:40.47,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.75,0:30:52.25,Default,host,0,0,0,,Your fever...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.76,0:30:56.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,It looks like it's gone down a bit since this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.60,0:31:03.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,The doctor said if you take your medicine and rest, you'll get better soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.60,0:31:12.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's quiet today. Mom and Dad said they couldn't make it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.29,0:31:13.79,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.76,0:31:21.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,Have you heard anything from I-chan and the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.76,0:31:25.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,Saki-chan, are you watching Tsukasa-chan too?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.32,0:31:28.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.32,0:31:30.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's the group chat from my old class.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.56,0:31:38.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,Everyone is out fruit picking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.44,0:31:44.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,The strawberries look so big and delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.40,0:31:52.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, everyone in class sent messages last year saying they wanted to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.88,0:31:56.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,Over there,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.96,0:31:59.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,the weather is so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.56,0:32:05.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,But it's raining here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.68,0:32:10.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,Am I the only one
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.08,0:32:14.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,who's going to stay like this forever?
Comment: 0,0:32:23.24,0:32:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.24,0:32:33.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,Back then, I couldn't go to school or play with everyone, so being alone just made me overthink things.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.00,0:32:36.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,I kept wondering, what if everyone drifts apart...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.28,0:32:41.92,Default,host,0,0,0,,and ends up going somewhere far away?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.76,0:32:48.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,I was always so scared and lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.36,0:32:54.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,I guess I'm just remembering how I felt back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.93,0:32:56.43,Default,host,0,0,0,,Saki...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.60,0:33:04.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's weird for me to feel this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.16,0:33:10.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,I know things are different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.15,0:33:15.65,Default,host,0,0,0,,I really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.24,0:33:22.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,Even if you know that, it's not strange to feel this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.28,0:33:30.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,Because those feelings repeated so many times that they became a part of Saki.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.88,0:33:33.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,A part of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.53,0:33:34.03,Default,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.36,0:33:39.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,So there's no need to reject that part of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.44,0:33:44.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm sure there are things you've achieved precisely because you had those feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.56,0:33:48.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,Things I've achieved?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.16,0:33:59.80,Default,host,0,0,0,,Like starting Leo/need with the four of you, or using those experiences to write songs that comfort others.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.00,0:34:06.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,So please, don't think of those feelings as weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.88,0:34:14.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,Even if you can't fully reconcile with them yet, I don't think you need to rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.84,0:34:16.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,MEIKO...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.12,0:34:22.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.36,0:34:29.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,I might still feel uneasy from time to time,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.72,0:34:39.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,but that's also a part of me, so I want to try accepting it bit by bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.05,0:34:41.55,Default,host,0,0,0,,I really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.04,0:34:50.36,Default,host,0,0,0,,But if things ever get painful again, please rely on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.28,0:34:58.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,There might not be much I can do, but I'm always here to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.80,0:35:01.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thank you, MEIKO.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.76,0:35:09.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.76,0:35:13.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.36,0:35:21.36,Default,host,0,0,0,,I thought I understood the reason, but I feel like there's still a lingering haze.
Comment: 0,0:35:24.56,0:35:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.56,0:35:28.36,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm sure you just haven't come to terms with it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.36,0:35:33.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,You can't just make those feelings of loneliness disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.57,0:35:35.07,Default,host,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.20,0:35:40.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,If that's the case, then we just have to reach them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.68,0:35:48.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,Like Ichi-chan and the others said, we'll be right there with them through our music!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.31,0:35:51.94,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.94,0:35:52.57,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.60,0:35:54.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.76,0:35:58.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,At tomorrow's solo show, we'll give a performance...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.96,0:36:00.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,that will make these feelings reach everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.00,0:36:05.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.24,0:36:09.34,Default,host,0,0,0,,And with that, we've finished watching the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.34,0:36:11.52,Default,host,0,0,0,,What did you all think?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.07,0:36:14.57,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.84,0:36:16.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.04,0:36:20.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's quite something.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.72,0:36:26.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,Rurika-san's words are so saving, they really hit home.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.08,0:36:51.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,During this recording, I felt like my understanding of Saki-chan has changed compared to when I first started, after going through so many stories to get to the Saki-chan we see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.20,0:36:56.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,Because I've spent so much time facing Saki-chan's feelings myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.92,0:36:58.52,Default,host,0,0,0,,well...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.52,0:37:01.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,Lately, I've been thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.52,0:37:10.38,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how much of this was just my own lack of skill back then, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.38,0:37:11.03,Default,host,0,0,0,,um...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.88,0:37:25.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,Saki-chan is so energetic, but she also has that past, and I found that balance really difficult to strike at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.16,0:37:34.46,Default,host,0,0,0,,Especially in the beginning, in Saki's very first stories, she was energetic, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.46,0:37:37.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,it was an energy that felt like she was pushing herself a little too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.88,0:37:49.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,There was this sense of impatience, like she wanted to do this and that, even though she's able to do so much more now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.44,0:37:53.77,Default,host,0,0,0,,She has so many things she wants to do because she couldn't do them before, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.77,0:37:54.45,Default,host,0,0,0,,how should I put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.75,0:37:56.25,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Comment: 0,0:37:58.00,0:38:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.00,0:38:05.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,Maybe that's not quite the right word, but she's not completely fulfilled. Yet, because she's naturally kind,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.00,0:38:08.14,Default,host,0,0,0,,and she's originally such a cheerful girl, she acts bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.14,0:38:12.06,Default,host,0,0,0,,I felt like there was a bit of an imbalance there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.06,0:38:19.58,Default,host,0,0,0,,As I've experienced all these different emotions with Saki-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.58,0:38:26.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,this story really goes back and forth between Saki-chan's past and present.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.60,0:38:36.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,I feel like this story is a distillation of everything that makes Saki-chan who she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.32,0:38:43.18,Default,host,0,0,0,,Looking back on the whole thing, I was reminded of what kind of girl Saki-chan is,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.18,0:38:48.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,and I realized that because she's grown, these new emotions were able to surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.72,0:38:53.98,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's all packed in there, but this time, it felt like...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.98,0:38:55.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,How should I put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.40,0:39:01.98,Default,host,0,0,0,,I was able to record my lines without really getting stuck at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.98,0:39:14.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,I understand Saki-chan's feelings so well now that there's no friction when I'm playing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.12,0:39:22.74,Default,host,0,0,0,,I can really feel that I have so many more tools for Saki-chan than I did at the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.74,0:39:27.26,Default,host,0,0,0,,Maybe this is just from a voice actress's perspective,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.26,0:39:38.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,but as a performer, I felt like I was truly at one with Saki-chan during the recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.16,0:39:44.42,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's become an unforgettable story for Saki-chan, and for me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.42,0:39:52.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,Looking at it from various angles, it's a story I'll never forget in my journey of facing Saki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.72,0:40:00.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,Episode 4 in particular had some painful parts, but seeing Saki-chan's...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.40,0:40:04.80,Default,host,0,0,0,,As someone wrote in the chat, it feels like we're seeing Saki-chan's roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.80,0:40:07.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,That phrasing really clicks with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.44,0:40:12.80,Default,host,0,0,0,,Because those things happened, Saki-chan has the mindset she does now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.80,0:40:22.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,How that will change from here, and how the choice Saki-chan made in this story will affect Leoni,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.00,0:40:25.36,Default,host,0,0,0,,honestly, I don't even know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.36,0:40:30.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,But I feel like I need to treasure this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.08,0:40:37.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,I think a time will come where both Saki-chan and I have to face what's next for Leoni.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.76,0:40:48.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's not exactly a lingering regret, but it made me feel like I want to keep facing things head-on from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.97,0:40:49.47,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.47,0:40:55.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,Looking back again, it's really painful, but it's so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.12,0:40:56.90,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm glad I could talk to Ruriko-san about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.90,0:41:03.80,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's such a blessing to have someone close by who can resonate with you even a little bit.
Comment: 0,0:41:04.63,0:41:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.63,0:41:05.13,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Comment: 0,0:41:05.80,0:41:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Card Illustrations ===
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.80,0:41:13.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,I've already talked quite a bit, but I'd like for us to take a look at the card illustrations together.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.28,0:41:16.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.52,0:41:20.70,Default,host,0,0,0,,Someone said they could feel the emotions through the changes in Saki's tone of voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.70,0:41:22.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.75,0:41:25.25,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.92,0:41:31.62,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm so happy that everyone understands it so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.62,0:41:39.42,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's hard to put into words, but I feel like I was really able to face Saki head-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.42,0:41:46.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,This story made me feel like the way I've faced her until now has finally taken shape.
Comment: 0,0:41:48.40,0:41:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Card Illustrations ===
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.40,0:41:55.88,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,So, before we look at the illustrations in detail, the illustration production team
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.88,0:42:00.48,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,sent in some comments about the outfits, so I'd like to introduce those.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.48,0:42:01.15,Default,host,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.04,0:42:03.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,Regarding the design...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.00,0:42:08.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,As Leo/need grows, they find themselves unable to deliver music to the fans close to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.32,0:42:15.06,Default,host,0,0,0,,The story follows Saki as she realizes she wants to keep playing the free, intimate music she always has.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.06,0:42:19.58,Default,host,0,0,0,,The overall motif is an adventurer traveling and observing the stars, representing their journey so far and where they are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.58,0:42:27.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,We used a blue and yellow gradient for Ichika and Honami.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.12,0:42:32.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,This represents the dawn breaking, which symbolizes the image of Leo/need changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.68,0:42:34.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,What a lovely comment.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.28,0:42:35.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.28,0:42:42.78,Default,host,0,0,0,,For Saki alone, we didn't use a gradient, but used yellow on the surface of the cloak covering her body.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.78,0:42:45.80,Default,host,0,0,0,,This is meant to express how she is hiding her true feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.80,0:42:47.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,Wait, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.68,0:42:48.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,We have to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.96,0:42:52.86,Default,host,0,0,0,,I want to actually look at the illustrations now and talk about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.86,0:42:54.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,Aren't they incredibly beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.84,0:42:56.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,They really are amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.32,0:43:03.78,Default,host,0,0,0,,I was just talking with the staff about it. They look like something out of a movie or a picture book.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.78,0:43:06.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,And look, her hair is short!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.20,0:43:09.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,Let's take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.25,0:43:10.75,Default,host,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Comment: 0,0:43:12.36,0:43:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.36,0:43:13.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,Saki...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.11,0:43:14.61,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.32,0:43:16.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,You're so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.45,0:43:17.95,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.60,0:43:31.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,The outfit and the background this time have this watercolor-like touch to them. She looks like an adventurer who's traveled to observe the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.76,0:43:35.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,The outfit definitely gives off that traveler vibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.28,0:43:38.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,It really does.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.80,0:43:39.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.32,0:43:43.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,But she has such a sorrowful expression, with those troubled eyebrows...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.20,0:43:47.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,Those lowered eyebrows are just...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.48,0:43:49.30,Default,host,0,0,0,,Well, there's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.30,0:43:51.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,And here is the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.72,0:43:53.54,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.54,0:43:59.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,Oh man, look at that expression she's making.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.04,0:43:59.54,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.31,0:44:01.81,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.04,0:44:06.34,Default,host,0,0,0,,It makes everyone's heart tighten.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.34,0:44:07.92,Default,host,0,0,0,,The illustration is gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.31,0:44:09.86,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.86,0:44:10.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,Her mouth... oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.68,0:44:15.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,Is that why her mouth is hidden?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.85,0:44:18.35,Default,host,0,0,0,,?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.17,0:44:19.67,Default,host,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.16,0:44:21.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.35,0:44:23.85,Default,host,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.24,0:44:26.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,So that's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.44,0:44:27.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.72,0:44:30.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.52,0:44:32.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.60,0:44:35.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,And next is Ichika...
Comment: 0,0:44:37.04,0:44:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.04,0:44:37.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.31,0:44:38.81,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.28,0:44:43.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,Ichi-chan's hair is short in this one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.20,0:44:45.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,It looks really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.64,0:44:49.36,Default,host,0,0,0,,She has this sort of ennui-filled smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.08,0:44:52.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,And the background is so cute too.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.12,0:44:52.80,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.40,0:44:57.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'd love to travel to a world like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.84,0:45:00.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,Hehe, it's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.12,0:45:05.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,Ichi-chan's outfit here is also amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.20,0:45:09.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,The level of detail is just incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.64,0:45:13.36,Default,host,0,0,0,,The short hair really suits her.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.92,0:45:19.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,And Honami-chan has such a great expression too.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.51,0:45:21.01,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.52,0:45:22.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,She's even got sweat dripping down.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.24,0:45:27.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,That straightforward gaze of hers is just perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.24,0:45:29.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's so clear and transparent.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.04,0:45:29.65,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.65,0:45:33.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,You know how people get offers to be voice actors?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.15,0:45:34.65,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.52,0:45:39.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,What do you think of this clear, refreshing vibe?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.72,0:45:42.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,That's our Ichika for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.08,0:45:43.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,She's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.36,0:45:46.78,Default,host,0,0,0,,The microphone really suits her!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.78,0:45:47.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,She's such a beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.28,0:45:49.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.20,0:45:51.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,They even included the sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.88,0:45:53.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,You're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.24,0:45:56.52,Default,host,0,0,0,,Someone in the chat wrote, "A beautiful woman even when dripping with sweat."
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.12,0:46:00.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,And... oh, sorry.
Comment: 0,0:46:00.24,0:46:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.24,0:46:00.95,Default,host,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.89,0:46:03.39,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.04,0:46:05.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,Hona-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.12,0:46:08.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,She's so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.76,0:46:10.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.24,0:46:15.52,Default,host,0,0,0,,Is this, um, a cloak?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.68,0:46:17.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.40,0:46:20.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,Or should I call it a skirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.68,0:46:27.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,The detail on the hem is just incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.84,0:46:31.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,And wow, what a beautiful profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.64,0:46:33.92,Default,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.76,0:46:37.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,If you look closely,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.76,0:46:45.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,there's a gradient with stars on it, and how should I put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.48,0:46:48.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,The inside of the cloak is decorated so beautifully too.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.40,0:46:50.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,Isn't it amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.27,0:46:52.77,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.36,0:46:55.66,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's like a tarot card.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.66,0:46:56.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.07,0:46:59.62,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.62,0:47:01.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,So mature and elegant.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.16,0:47:03.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,Saki too.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.20,0:47:04.62,Default,host,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.62,0:47:05.35,Default,host,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.20,0:47:07.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,Saki is cute too.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.36,0:47:11.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,The side angle is so pretty, I'm just staring at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.16,0:47:12.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,I totally agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.64,0:47:15.09,Default,host,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.09,0:47:15.65,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.17,0:47:17.67,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.24,0:47:21.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,She's overflowing with motherly vibes.
Comment: 0,0:47:22.56,0:47:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.56,0:47:23.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,Hona...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.44,0:47:25.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,She's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.63,0:47:28.13,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.52,0:47:32.54,Default,host,0,0,0,,The tarot cards, I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.54,0:47:34.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,they're called the Aiugara Tarot.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.28,0:47:38.53,Default,host,0,0,0,,Her mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.53,0:47:39.13,Default,host,0,0,0,,Shiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.20,0:47:41.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,Shibao is so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.44,0:47:45.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.00,0:47:46.06,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's just so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.06,0:47:47.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's so soothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.56,0:47:49.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,So peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.29,0:47:50.79,Default,host,0,0,0,,So peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.92,0:47:56.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,And I personally love this illustration so much too.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.91,0:47:58.41,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.64,0:48:01.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,Isn't it crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.92,0:48:04.58,Default,host,0,0,0,,Isn't it just incredible?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.58,0:48:08.80,Default,host,0,0,0,,And look at the stars she's holding in her hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.05,0:48:10.55,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.23,0:48:12.97,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.97,0:48:13.71,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.68,0:48:16.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm so grateful for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.40,0:48:21.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's seriously just too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.12,0:48:26.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,Everything is so perfect that I can't even explain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.00,0:48:30.92,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm just so thankful for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.12,0:48:33.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's too wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.28,0:48:40.82,Default,host,0,0,0,,The way her hair flows, and of course the background, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.82,0:48:44.62,Default,host,0,0,0,,how she's holding everyone's stars, and the outfit looks so good on her,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.62,0:48:47.92,Default,host,0,0,0,,and that expression... I could go on forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.92,0:48:48.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,it's literally everything.
Comment: 0,0:48:50.88,0:48:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.88,0:48:52.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,Everything is just too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.12,0:48:53.52,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.59,0:48:55.09,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.08,0:48:57.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,It really feels like they're watching over her.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.22,0:48:58.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.72,0:49:01.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.55,0:49:03.05,Default,host,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.87,0:49:05.37,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.44,0:49:11.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,I touched on this during the story earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.19,0:49:13.69,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.72,0:49:17.80,Default,host,0,0,0,,but everyone, look at that expression while she says that quote.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.39,0:49:19.89,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.20,0:49:22.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.04,0:49:25.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,This illustration hits even harder after seeing that scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.76,0:49:28.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,I really love this expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.72,0:49:31.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,Rurika...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.76,0:49:35.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm just so grateful that you're here, that you exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.43,0:49:36.93,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.48,0:49:39.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,And finally, we have Shiho-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.76,0:49:40.70,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.70,0:49:42.86,Default,host,0,0,0,,This is what the outfits look like this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.86,0:49:46.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,You're right, Saki-chan's cape is...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.52,0:50:02.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's yellow, but the gradient represents the dawn breaking, which symbolizes how Leoni is changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.03,0:50:03.53,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.12,0:50:04.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,That's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.48,0:50:08.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,I want to take a closer look at the outfits.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.52,0:50:11.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,Since they're adventurers, they're even carrying maps.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.48,0:50:13.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.16,0:50:14.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.64,0:50:19.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,We've looked at a lot, and it was all so good.
Comment: 0,0:50:20.96,0:50:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Song Watchalong ===
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.96,0:50:30.06,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,And now, we have the song written specifically for this event by Kuriyama Yuri,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.06,0:50:33.88,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,"Hanamusubi". Wow, my pronunciation was great just then.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.88,0:50:34.55,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,The 2D MV...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.68,0:50:43.48,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,The 2D MV was just released a moment ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.48,0:50:44.92,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,I mean, it really was just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.68,0:50:48.08,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,It hasn't even been an hour yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.04,0:50:54.94,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,Since it's out, let's watch it together and talk about the song.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.94,0:50:58.45,Default,host,0,0,0,,First, let's take a look at the 2D MV.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.45,0:50:59.09,Default,host,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.28,0:51:09.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,Finding the conclusion I'd waited for all along in this night.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.12,0:51:27.36,Default,host,0,0,0,,Hurriedly hiding it, pretending not to know, enduring the pain of a love forced into a shape that doesn't fit, always feeling cramped, yet unable to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.04,0:51:29.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.63,0:51:30.13,Default,host,0,0,0,,If I speak,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.84,0:51:36.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,it feels like everything will crumble, so I keep my lips sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.57,0:51:38.07,Default,host,0,0,0,,Speak,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.28,0:51:40.92,Default,host,0,0,0,,no matter what, speak,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.56,0:51:45.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,and unravel this heart of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.87,0:51:47.37,Default,host,0,0,0,,Unchanging,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.84,0:51:51.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,pinning back my hair,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.84,0:52:06.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,connecting the threads of fate to become a blooming flower, seeking a glimmer of hope in the gaps of an unchanging tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.76,0:52:12.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,I've realized what true hope is.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.00,0:52:34.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,We just watched "Hanamusubi", and that 2D MV is just incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.04,0:52:35.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.00,0:52:47.06,Default,host,0,0,0,,Since Kuriyama-san wrote this for us, I'd like to talk a bit about the recording session.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.06,0:52:59.78,Default,host,0,0,0,,During recording, they usually give us an explanation beforehand about the story and what kind of song it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.78,0:53:05.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,When I heard the details and saw the song before the recording,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.96,0:53:13.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,I could really feel how much of this event's story and Saki Tenma's feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.88,0:53:20.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,were poured into the writing. It really came through in the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.76,0:53:30.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,You can definitely feel Kuriyama-san's signature style and melody in there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.24,0:53:35.42,Default,host,0,0,0,,Kuriyama-san also shared some comments about it on the Wondershow Channel.
Comment: 0,0:53:35.42,0:53:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.42,0:53:44.54,Default,host,0,0,0,,I think the comments we received really captured the intent behind the song and what's in store for Leoni.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.54,0:53:48.18,Default,host,0,0,0,,It makes me feel like we weren't wrong at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.18,0:53:55.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,It feels like I'm savoring every single lyric. This time, it's like Saki-chan's emotions...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.28,0:54:06.92,Default,host,0,0,0,,were gathered up and processed into the song. It gives off that kind of feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.92,0:54:14.50,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's so bittersweet. The chorus is quite high, which actually makes it feel a bit desperate,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.50,0:54:19.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,like it's incredibly delicate. How should I put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.12,0:54:21.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's desperate and painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.72,0:54:27.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,The way the chorus hits those high notes in that flow...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.04,0:54:40.16,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's not just sadness or impatience or desperation. It's expressed so beautifully and delicately.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.16,0:54:53.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,Listening to it again, everyone's voices blend so well. Not to toot our own horn, but it's just so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.48,0:54:57.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's really great.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.44,0:55:01.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,Their expressions are amazing too.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.76,0:55:02.43,Default,host,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.95,0:55:04.45,Default,host,0,0,0,,Just look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.28,0:55:07.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm just staring at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.28,0:55:10.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,No matter how many times I watch this, it's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.55,0:55:12.05,Default,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.72,0:55:16.52,Default,host,0,0,0,,I hope you all watch it many times too.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.52,0:55:31.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,Please, take in this story and listen to "Hanamusubi" again. I'm sure your thoughts and interpretations will grow,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.20,0:55:34.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,and you'll wonder what's going to happen to Leoni from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.88,0:55:37.30,Default,host,0,0,0,,I can feel a bit of that from this song too.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.30,0:55:42.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,It feels a little ominous, which makes me worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.40,0:55:44.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,I can sense that from the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.32,0:55:51.88,Default,host,0,0,0,,I honestly don't know what's coming next either,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.88,0:55:59.00,Default,host,0,0,0,,so I want to savor Leoni's journey along with all of you while listening to this song.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.00,0:55:59.50,Default,host,0,0,0,,It's so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.40,0:56:01.02,Default,host,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.02,0:56:06.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,This MV is uploaded to the official ProSeka YouTube channel,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.40,0:56:08.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,so please go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.00,0:56:14.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,Well, our time today was short, but this has been ProSeka AfterTalk.
Comment: 0,0:56:14.84,0:56:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.84,0:56:20.54,Default,host,0,0,0,,And that concludes the "Twinkling Stars in the Night Sky" edition.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.54,0:56:24.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,Everyone watching the stream, how did you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.84,0:56:29.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,I see so many wonderful comments coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.04,0:56:29.80,Default,host,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.80,0:56:36.40,Default,host,0,0,0,,Someone said, "Saki-chan's painful delivery before the chorus was so good."
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.40,0:56:37.92,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.55,0:56:40.05,Default,host,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.04,0:56:47.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,When we record, Icchan usually goes first. She's just so...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.36,0:56:58.02,Default,host,0,0,0,,She's such an amazing singer, her takes are already so polished. I think everyone uses her vocals as a base,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.02,0:57:03.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,like a guide for how the rest of us should record our parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.08,0:57:11.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,But this time, partly because of the song's atmosphere,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.28,0:57:17.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,I prioritized putting Saki-chan's emotions into it above all else.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.24,0:57:23.36,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to hear that the sadness I felt really came through to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.63,0:57:25.13,Default,host,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.88,0:57:30.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,"I'm glad you talked about so many things," and "It was great to hear your stories."
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.32,0:57:31.58,Default,host,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.58,0:57:32.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,Such kind comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.31,0:57:35.02,Default,host,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.02,0:57:40.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,I always say this, but I really love these AfterTalks.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.28,0:57:40.95,Default,host,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.56,0:57:51.46,Default,host,0,0,0,,Recording is usually a solo job, even though I know you're all watching over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.46,0:58:00.02,Default,host,0,0,0,,But during AfterTalk, I get to share my feelings with everyone as a fan too.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.02,0:58:10.20,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm not just the voice actress; I'm a viewer cheering for Saki-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.20,0:58:15.32,Default,host,0,0,0,,cheering for Leoni, and saying things like, "That was so painful," or "She's grown so much."
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.32,0:58:23.08,Default,host,0,0,0,,I love having time to talk about all that. It went by so fast, I might have talked too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.08,0:58:28.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,It was a bit of a sad story, but it's become a very important
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.72,0:58:36.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,event story for me. I'm so grateful for this time to look back on it with all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.24,0:58:39.36,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for joining me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.88,0:58:45.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're all wondering what's going to happen next,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.28,0:58:51.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,but there's no doubt that the members of Leoni all care deeply for one another.
Comment: 0,0:58:52.24,0:58:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.24,0:58:56.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,Everyone cares so much about each other, they're all such good kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.04,0:59:10.44,Default,host,0,0,0,,Because they're facing each other properly, I think their feelings will continue to grow in all sorts of ways from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.44,0:59:17.26,Default,host,0,0,0,,I don't know for sure yet, so this is just my own personal take on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.26,0:59:20.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,But I'm planning to keep watching over them as they grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.96,0:59:26.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,I'd be happy if you'd join me in watching over Leo/need and Saki-chan too.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.12,0:59:28.56,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.28,0:59:36.72,Default,host,0,0,0,,By the way, for those who haven't finished the story for "Stars Twinkle in the Night Sky We Look Up At" yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.72,0:59:43.48,Default,host,0,0,0,,you can read it all in the Event Stories menu once the next event starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.48,0:59:44.90,Default,host,0,0,0,,Please go give it a read.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.90,0:59:46.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,You can read it as many times as you want, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.25,0:59:47.95,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.95,0:59:50.28,Default,host,0,0,0,,And with that, it's already time to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.80,0:59:55.24,Default,host,0,0,0,,I always wonder if I've left anything unsaid, but I think I've talked quite a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.24,1:00:00.42,Default,host,0,0,0,,I hope my feelings reached all of you, even just a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.42,1:00:04.10,Default,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for sticking with me until the very end.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.10,1:00:06.80,Default,host,0,0,0,,Well then, see you again next time!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.51,1:00:08.25,Default,host,0,0,0,,Bye
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.25,1:00:08.99,Default,host,0,0,0,,bye!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.87,1:00:40.37,Default,host,0,0,0,,.
